  "question": {
    "text": "In a compound microscope, the magnified virtual image is formed at a distance of <math><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>&#160;cm</mtext></mrow></math> from the eye-piece. The focal length of its objective lens is <math><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#160;cm</mtext></mrow></math>. If the magnification is <math><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></math> and the tube length of the microscope is <math><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#160;cm</mtext></mrow></math>, then the focal length of the eye-piece lens (in <math><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></math>) is ______",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6.25",
  "solution": {
